{"additionalPlain":"Ensero has offices in Canada (Saskatoon, Vancouver and Whitehorse) and the US (Denver), and is well established as an innovative leader in regulatory, environmental management, water treatment, remediation technologies, and facility operations. We believe in giving you the opportunity to learn and to help make an impact on the sustainability of the environment.\n \nAll qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability or protected veteran status.\n","additional":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Ensero has offices in Canada (Saskatoon, Vancouver and Whitehorse) and the US (Denver), and is well established as an innovative leader in regulatory, environmental management, water treatment, remediation technologies, and facility operations. We believe in giving you the opportunity to learn and to help make an impact on the sustainability of the environment.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability or protected veteran status.</span></div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-time","department":"Ensero Solutions","location":"Vancouver, BC","team":"Ensero Solutions","allLocations":["Vancouver, BC","Toronto, ON","Saskatoon, SK","Whitehorse, YT"]},"createdAt":1778880667097,"descriptionPlain":"Ensero Solutions is an environmental consulting and remediation business with specific expertise in environmental assessments, permitting, regulatory and compliance services, active/passive water treatment, mine water management, and turnkey remediation services for the mining industry and broader industrial sectors. At Ensero, we get the opportunity to make a positive impact on the environment and people’s lives. We’re building a culture where people can grow their careers and are challenged to solve our client’s toughest environmental problems.\n \n \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Ensero Solutions is an environmental consulting and remediation business with specific expertise in environmental assessments, permitting, regulatory and compliance services, active/passive water treatment, mine water management, and turnkey remediation services for the mining industry and broader industrial sectors. At Ensero, we get the opportunity to make a positive impact on the environment and people’s lives. We’re building a culture where people can grow their careers and are challenged to solve our client’s toughest environmental problems.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Senior Project Manager - Mine Water Management</strong></div>\n<div>Vancouver, BC; Saskatoon, SK; Toronto, ON; Remote - Regular Full-Time</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Reporting to the Senior Operations Manager, the Senior Project Manager is responsible for providing leadership and management of water treatment and water management projects for Ensero clients.</div>","id":"42ef2467-d1b3-44e6-9759-f631f4020808","lists":[{"text":"About the Role","content":"\n<li>Provide direction and leads the performance (scope, schedule and cost) of water management and water treatment projects for mining clients.</li>\n<li>Develops integrated project engineering schedule including critical path for the end to end tasks and activities necessary to successfully implement projects.</li>\n<li>Works with client and resource managers to ensure resources and dependencies are identified and assigned to the project.</li>\n<li>Manages conceptual water treatment design through detailed design stages for clients, including vendor packages and balance of plant scopes.</li>\n<li>Ensures assigned resources are executing as planned.</li>\n<li>Provides tracking and reporting to plan and develops recovery plans as required.</li>\n<li>Makes or directs analysis of project financial performance, ensuring on-budget delivery and management of change. &nbsp;</li>\n<li>Supports risk analysis with project management, and manages complex project delivery and technical risk.</li>\n<li>Monitors and promotes environmental health and worker safety.</li>\n<li>Mentors junior/intermediate project team members.</li>\n<li>Leads the development of technical deliverables and programs in area(s) of expertise.</li>\n<li>Conducts senior reviews of technical deliverables and programs in area(s) of expertise.</li>\n<li>Oversees/ provides expert input on development of field investigations in area(s) of expertise.</li>\n<li>Complete other projects, reporting and tasks as assigned.</li>\n<li>All other related duties as required.&nbsp;</li>\n"},{"text":"About You","content":"\n<li>Bachelor’s degree in engineering is preferred, with science, construction management, or a relevant technical field as alternatives.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Minimum 10 years of project management experience.</li>\n<li>Experience working in environmental consulting or project consulting setting is an asset.</li>\n<li>Experience delivering complex projects that include a mix of engineering and technical services such as treatment systems design and construction, particularly in northern and/or remote mine settings.</li>\n<li>Project Management Professional Certification and/or Professional Engineer designation are preferred.</li>\n"}],"salaryRange":{"min":130000,"max":170000,"currency":"CAD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"text":"Senior Project Manager - Mine Water Management","country":"CA","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Ensero Solutions is an environmental consulting and remediation business with specific expertise in environmental assessments, permitting, regulatory and compliance services, active/passive water treatment, mine water management, and turnkey remediation services for the mining industry and broader industrial sectors. At Ensero, we get the opportunity to make a positive impact on the environment and people&rsquo;s lives. We&rsquo;re building a culture where people can grow their careers and are challenged to solve our client&rsquo;s toughest environmental problems.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","openingPlain":"Ensero Solutions is an environmental consulting and remediation business with specific expertise in environmental assessments, permitting, regulatory and compliance services, active/passive water treatment, mine water management, and turnkey remediation services for the mining industry and broader industrial sectors. At Ensero, we get the opportunity to make a positive impact on the environment and people’s lives. We’re building a culture where people can grow their careers and are challenged to solve our client’s toughest environmental problems.\n \n \n","descriptionBody":"<div><strong>Senior Project Manager - Mine Water Management</strong></div>\n<div>Vancouver, BC; Saskatoon, SK; Toronto, ON; Remote - Regular Full-Time</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Reporting to the Senior Operations Manager, the Senior Project Manager is responsible for providing leadership and management of water treatment and water management projects for Ensero clients.</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/true-environmental/42ef2467-d1b3-44e6-9759-f631f4020808","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/true-environmental/42ef2467-d1b3-44e6-9759-f631f4020808/apply"}